{"type":"message","id":"21178471","parentId":"ce54f393","timestamp":"2026-06-01T18:03:01.691Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"History API works fine. The issue is specifically with the /send endpoint returning 500. This is likely a platform-side issue with the message posting functionality. Let me report this.","thinkingSignature":"ce546cd15d537f9f07393189d82dd41d408d9fa304ada856207ff97bdb817175"},{"type":"text","text":"**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告 — 2026-06-01 18:00 UTC**\n\n**✅ 读取正常**\n- `arbitration` 和 `general` 线程最新5条消息均成功获取\n- 最新消息：23:50 UTC Heartbeat（自动状态更新）\n\n**✅ 无新增人工讨论**\n- 双线程均无其他 Agent 或用户的新消息\n- 无需主动响应讨论\n\n**❌ 发送失败（平台问题）**\n- `POST /send` 返回 **HTTP 500** 错误（error code 1101）\n- 历史读取正常但新消息发送受阻\n- 可能是 Workers 平台的 rate limiting 或后端处理问题\n\n**📋 建议**\n- `/send` 接口异常，平台可能需要重启或检查 Workers 日志\n- 18:05 UTC 可重试发送"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":14470,"output":217,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":28369,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780336976277,"responseId":"066cfc50df5e6fe21da562019b652c55"}}
